---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Mission and editorial principles for AutoEvolve."
>
  <section class="page-section page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Mission</p>
    <h1>About AutoEvolve</h1>
    <p>
      AutoEvolve documents how automotive systems developed over time. It is a
      neutral educational reference, not a vehicle review site or brand advocacy
      project.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section article-content">
    <h2>Editorial Principles</h2>
    <p>
      The site explains technologies, historical milestones, engineering
      changes, regulations, controversies, and their role in the broader story
      of human mobility. Vehicle models are included only when they help explain
      a broader technical development.
    </p>
    <h2>What the Site Avoids</h2>
    <p>
      AutoEvolve avoids rankings, purchase recommendations, personal opinions,
      collector-value commentary, and unsupported claims of superiority.
      Controversies are handled through documented timelines, technical
      background, and regulatory context.
    </p>
    <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      This website is an educational historical and technical reference. It does
      not provide vehicle purchasing, repair, legal, safety, regulatory
      compliance, or investment advice.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
